# Never translate line endings, on any platform.
#
# A Windows checkout with the default core.autocrlf=true rewrites every text
# file to CRLF on the way out of Git. That would change the bytes of the
# golden fixtures and of every test's source tree, so the digests they assert
# would not reproduce — a determinism failure caused entirely by the checkout.
#
# The bundle format already sidesteps this for Git sources by reading commit
# trees rather than working directories (DP-011). This file is for everything
# that is an ordinary file on disk: fixtures, testdata, and the repository
# itself.
* -text

# Golden vectors are bytes, not text. Marking them binary also stops diff
# tools from trying to render them.
internal/canonical/testdata/format/** binary
